{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free Online Action RPG in a Steampunk World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a convict who has been thrown into the dungeons by a powerful ruling organization. Embark on a journey through a world devastated by a mysterious asteroid, scattering powerful crystal shards across distinct world zones brimming with mutated creatures and steampunk enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into post-apocalyptic dungeons that randomize upon each visit and ascend to new heights of power with epic loot, extensive talent tree progression, and lootable skills with procedural skill trees. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/33b9b6157c8aa41277b4108bbdda74ac.poster.avif?t=1772726450\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/33b9b6157c8aa41277b4108bbdda74ac.webm?t=1772726450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/33b9b6157c8aa41277b4108bbdda74ac.mp4?t=1772726450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLASSLESS CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a character from the primary attributes strength, dexterity or intelligence. Specialize in a primary attribute or experiment with various combinations to create your ideal character build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTENSIVE TALENT TREE PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your path to mastery with an extensive tree of talents. Gain experience and unlock new powers to form synergies with your items and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/4fe89effdf6dffbc7e16e4e76a688eb9.poster.avif?t=1772726450\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/4fe89effdf6dffbc7e16e4e76a688eb9.webm?t=1772726450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/4fe89effdf6dffbc7e16e4e76a688eb9.mp4?t=1772726450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOTABLE SKILLS WITH RANDOMIZED SKILL TREES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot skills of different rarities and unlock your path of choice through procedurally generated skill trees. Tailor the skill to your build with the help of unique nodes and quality upgrades. Insert lootable socketables known as skill crests for further customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/6149b983f7b5d85e138ad1ca2bc9427a.poster.avif?t=1772726450\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/6149b983f7b5d85e138ad1ca2bc9427a.webm?t=1772726450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/6149b983f7b5d85e138ad1ca2bc9427a.mp4?t=1772726450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEEP ITEMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, upgrade, salvage and trade your skills and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Crystalfall, game mechanics revolve around item strength and theorycrafting to create synergies with skills and talents. Explore different character builds by growing your arsenal of powerful steampunk items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEASONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasons offer a fresh start with new content to explore and thrilling challenges to overcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDGAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an endless endgame with new maps and challenging bosses. Journey deeper into the world of Crystalfall to uncover its secrets, pushing your hero to their limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet, interact and trade items with other players.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2574970?t=1772726450","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2574970?t=1772726450","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/3199538c1b612738284025e5d77e420f1c5ab9bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772726450","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/3199538c1b612738284025e5d77e420f1c5ab9bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772726450","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"demos":[{"appid":3346210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free Online Action RPG in a Steampunk World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a convict who has been thrown into the dungeons by a powerful ruling organization. Embark on a journey through a world devastated by a mysterious asteroid, scattering powerful crystal shards across distinct world zones brimming with mutated creatures and steampunk enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into post-apocalyptic dungeons that randomize upon each visit and ascend to new heights of power with epic loot, extensive talent tree progression, and lootable skills with procedural skill trees. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/33b9b6157c8aa41277b4108bbdda74ac.poster.avif?t=1772726450\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/33b9b6157c8aa41277b4108bbdda74ac.webm?t=1772726450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/33b9b6157c8aa41277b4108bbdda74ac.mp4?t=1772726450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLASSLESS CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a character from the primary attributes strength, dexterity or intelligence. Specialize in a primary attribute or experiment with various combinations to create your ideal character build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTENSIVE TALENT TREE PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your path to mastery with an extensive tree of talents. Gain experience and unlock new powers to form synergies with your items and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/4fe89effdf6dffbc7e16e4e76a688eb9.poster.avif?t=1772726450\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/4fe89effdf6dffbc7e16e4e76a688eb9.webm?t=1772726450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/4fe89effdf6dffbc7e16e4e76a688eb9.mp4?t=1772726450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOTABLE SKILLS WITH RANDOMIZED SKILL TREES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot skills of different rarities and unlock your path of choice through procedurally generated skill trees. Tailor the skill to your build with the help of unique nodes and quality upgrades. Insert lootable socketables known as skill crests for further customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/6149b983f7b5d85e138ad1ca2bc9427a.poster.avif?t=1772726450\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/6149b983f7b5d85e138ad1ca2bc9427a.webm?t=1772726450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/6149b983f7b5d85e138ad1ca2bc9427a.mp4?t=1772726450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEEP ITEMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, upgrade, salvage and trade your skills and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Crystalfall, game mechanics revolve around item strength and theorycrafting to create synergies with skills and talents. Explore different character builds by growing your arsenal of powerful steampunk items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEASONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasons offer a fresh start with new content to explore and thrilling challenges to overcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDGAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an endless endgame with new maps and challenging bosses. Journey deeper into the world of Crystalfall to uncover its secrets, pushing your hero to their limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet, interact and trade items with other players.</p>","developers":["CRG Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"descript